## Verification Plan

### Deploy & Smoke Test
1. Run `firebase deploy --only functions` from the project root
2. Open browser and hit: `https://us-central1-dailyplanet-72e33.cloudfunctions.net/news/headlines`
3. Should return a JSON list of articles
4. Hit: `https://us-central1-dailyplanet-72e33.cloudfunctions.net/weather?lat=12.97&lon=77.59`
5. Should return weather JSON

### Flutter Test
Run `flutter run` and verify news loads and weather shows on the home screen.
